---------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY MAPPING (web → native)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  props:  stats: ChargingStats | null (computed by the parent charging list from
            useCharging → computeStats) + the currency symbol / locale / global
            decimal precision the web reads from useFormatting
            → one QuickMetricsUpdate snapshot pushed by a QuickMetricsSource
              (P1/S8); QuickMetricsProjection.metrics() derives the six tiles from it.
  shell:  <GlassPanel className="p-3 sm:p-5">  (the web wraps in a glass card)
            → TSFadeIn + tokenized glass card (Color.TS.surfaceGlass + TSRadius.lg +
              Color.TS.border stroke, TSSpacing.xl padding).
  grid:   grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-6 text-center
            → LazyVGrid(.adaptive(minimum: 104)) — 2 tiles compact, growing toward 6
              on a regular/large width (the same responsive intent).
  tile1:  Home   <p text-emerald-300><AnimatedNumber homeCount/></p> + <Home/> label
            → QuickMetric(id home, tone .success→Color.TS.statusSuccess,
              systemImage "house.fill", animatesValue true), value = count(homeCount).
  tile2:  Supercharger <p text-rose-300><AnimatedNumber scCount/></p> + <Bolt/>
            → tone .danger→Color.TS.statusDanger, systemImage "bolt.fill",
              value = count(scCount).
  tile3:  DC Fast <p text-amber-300><AnimatedNumber dcCount/></p> + <Zap/>
            → tone .warning→Color.TS.statusWarning, systemImage "bolt.car.fill",
              value = count(dcCount).
  tile4:  Total Time <p text-primary>{formatDuration(totalDuration)}</p>
            → tone .primary→Color.TS.textPrimary, no glyph,
              value = duration(minutes: totalDuration).
  tile5:  Monthly Avg <p text-primary><Currency totalCost/12 precision=0/></p>
            → value = currency(totalCost/12, symbol, 0 dp).
  tile6:  Per Session <p text-primary>{fmtWithUnit(totalEnergy/count, 'kWh')}</p>
            → value = withUnit(totalEnergy/count, 'kWh', global precision (default 2)).
  empty:  stats === null ? <EmptyState message=t('charging.noMetrics')>
            → .empty phase → QuickMetricsEmpty (ContentUnavailableView, chart glyph).
  anim:   <AnimatedNumber> (web count-up) → the shared native idiom
            .contentTransition(.numericText()) (cf. TSAnimatedNumber), gated by
            Reduce Motion, applied only to the three count tiles (animatesValue).
  fmt:    fmtNumber(v,d)/safeNumber → QuickMetricsFormat.number/safe (NumberFormatter
            .decimal, .halfUp, grouping, non-finite→0); <Currency> precision=0 →
            currency(); fmtWithUnit → withUnit(); formatDurationMinutes →
            duration() ("{h}h {m}m"/"{m}m"/'—', hours floored + minutes rounded
            half-away-from-zero, '—' for non-finite/negative).
  i18n:   t('charging.metrics.home|supercharger|dcFast|totalTime|monthlyAvg|
            perSession', …) + t('charging.noMetrics', …)
            → QuickMetricsStrings facade, table "QuickMetrics".

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface):
  loading  → QuickMetricsLoading (six TSSkeleton tiles in the same responsive grid;
             reduce-motion safe)
  content  → QuickMetricsGrid (the six populated tiles)
  empty    → QuickMetricsEmpty (ContentUnavailableView, web "…noMetrics" message)
  error    → QuickMetricsError (QueryError-equiv, Retry → model.refresh())
  stale    → freshness chip (Stale) + QuickMetricsConnectivityBanner + ONE guarded
             auto-refresh (re-armed on return to live)
  offline  → freshness chip (Offline) + banner; keeps cached tiles, no refetch
  (The web strip itself only splits content/empty; the loading/error/stale/offline
   envelope the parent list owns is reproduced here so no state is a blank box. The
   freshness chip + banner show ONLY when not live, keeping the healthy state as
   visually clean as the web source — which has no chrome.)
a11y: container summary (strip label + each tile's "{label} {value}"), per-tile
  VoiceOver "{label}: {value}", icons accessibilityHidden, reduce-motion animation
  gate, Dynamic Type via system fonts/tokens, minimumScaleFactor on value/label.
telemetry: P1/S11 view.opened(surface:"QuickMetrics") emitted once on appear.
binding: P1/S8 QuickMetricsSource seam (production impl over shared state holders —
  the useCharging→computeStats projection + useFormatting prefs); the view performs
  NO networking. Previews/tests drive InMemoryQuickMetricsSource.

